<title>MEXICO: Cifra says to pay 0.25 peso dividend.</title>
<headline>Cifra says to pay 0.25 peso dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retail giant Cifra SA de CV said Friday it would pay an extraordinary dividend of 0.25 peso per share as of March 13.</p>
<p>Shareholders must present Coupon No. 33 to receive their dividend, Cifra said.</p>
<p>Cifra's board approved the dividend payment on Thursday, the company reported to the Mexican stock exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
